00:55:26.080 --> 00:55:27.080
you know, denomination

00:55:27.080 --> 00:55:28.080
or theology or whatever.

00:55:28.080 --> 00:55:30.080
The red is wine.

00:55:30.080 --> 00:55:32.080
The white is grape juice.

00:55:32.080 --> 00:55:33.080
And then finally,

00:55:33.080 --> 00:55:34.080
you can just partake whenever

00:55:34.080 --> 00:55:35.080
and however you'd like.

