01:06:46.080 --> 01:06:59.360
All right, now let me send you into your week with this blessing.

01:06:59.360 --> 01:07:05.840
You can hold out your hands in a posture of receiving or just open your heart to these

01:07:05.840 --> 01:07:08.780
words.

01:07:08.780 --> 01:07:12.360
You are a child of God.

01:07:12.360 --> 01:07:14.040
You.

01:07:14.040 --> 01:07:17.479
You are a child of God.

01:07:17.479 --> 01:07:23.699
This is true on your best day, and it is true on your worst day.

01:07:23.699 --> 01:07:31.360
So as you go into your week ahead with its yet to be determined highs and lows and everything

01:07:31.360 --> 01:07:40.719
in between, go filled with the assurance that you are loved, that you are worthy, and that

01:07:40.719 --> 01:07:44.919
you are accepted just as you are.

01:07:44.919 --> 01:07:52.159
And go filled with God's Holy Spirit and the desire to extend these same gifts of grace

01:07:52.159 --> 01:07:58.280
and unconditional love to everyone you come in contact with.

01:07:58.280 --> 01:07:59.800
Be blessed, and we'll see you next Sunday.

01:08:10.719 --> 01:08:39.720
I want a house with a crowded table, and a place by the fire for it to burn, and a place

01:08:40.720 --> 01:08:49.720
by the fire for it to burn, and a place by the fire for it to burn.

01:08:49.720 --> 01:08:51.500
I want a place for everyone.

01:08:51.500 --> 01:08:53.520
Let us take upon the world while we're young and able, and bring us back together when

01:08:53.600 --> 01:08:56.600
the day is done.

01:08:56.600 --> 01:09:03.100
And bring us back together when the day is done.

01:09:03.100 --> 01:09:09.100
And bring us back together when the day is done.

01:09:09.100 --> 01:09:12.479
When the day is done.

